{"id":"e1782799288dd0ec","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier.md","title":"Definition — 预层的筛真值对象与特征映射","display":"Definition — 预层的筛真值对象与特征映射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier","aliases":["14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier"],"display":"Definition — 预层的筛真值对象与特征映射","source_ref":"I.4, pp.37–39","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","[[14-df-presheaf-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 预层的筛真值对象与特征映射"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.4, pp.37–39"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93c6dd137bf8628e\" href=\"?note=93c6dd137bf8628e\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits\">14-df-presheaf-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55b5b594c94a4b33\" href=\"?note=55b5b594c94a4b33\" title=\"14-df-sieve-pullback\">14-df-sieve-pullback</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span> 为实际子预层，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(C)\\subseteq P(C)\">\\(A(C)\\subseteq P(C)\\)</span> 且限制为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 限制在这些子集上的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\">\\(C,D\\)</span> 为对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:D\\to C\">\\(u:D\\to C\\)</span>。筛、极大筛和筛逆像采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"55b5b594c94a4b33\" href=\"?note=55b5b594c94a4b33\" title=\"14-df-sieve-pullback\">14-df-sieve-pullback</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"93c6dd137bf8628e\" href=\"?note=93c6dd137bf8628e\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits\">14-df-presheaf-finite-limits</a> 中逐点取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{*\\}\">\\(\\{*\\}\\)</span> 的终预层。自然变换均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a> 的带源靶三元组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_C:=\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C),\\qquad\\Omega_0(C):=\\{S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\operatorname{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_C:=\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C),\\qquad\\Omega_0(C):=\\{S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\operatorname{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_1(u):=(\\Omega_0(C),\\Omega_0(D),(S\\mapsto\\operatorname{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(u,S))),\\qquad\\Omega:=(\\Omega_0,\\Omega_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Omega_1(u):=(\\Omega_0(C),\\Omega_0(D),(S\\mapsto\\operatorname{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(u,S))),\\qquad\\Omega:=(\\Omega_0,\\Omega_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{true}:=\\left(1,\\Omega,\\left((\\{*\\},\\Omega(C),(*\\mapsto t_C))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{true}:=\\left(1,\\Omega,\\left((\\{*\\},\\Omega(C),(*\\mapsto t_C))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A:=\\left(P,\\Omega,\\left(\\left(P(C),\\Omega(C),\\left(p\\mapsto\\{u\\in t_C\\mid P(u)(p)\\in A(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\}\\right)\\right)\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_A:=\\left(P,\\Omega,\\left(\\left(P(C),\\Omega(C),\\left(p\\mapsto\\{u\\in t_C\\mid P(u)(p)\\in A(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\}\\right)\\right)\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>筛的前合成闭包保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(p)\">\\(\\chi_A(p)\\)</span> 是筛。筛拉回与恒等和复合相容，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 是预层。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span> 的自然性等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(P(v)p)=v^*\\chi_A(p)\">\\(\\chi_A(P(v)p)=v^*\\chi_A(p)\\)</span>，逐箭头展开即可验证。所有非基础符号均由本书内部原子定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.4, pp.37–39。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"93c6dd137bf8628e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴；$P$ 为预层，$A\\subseteq P$ 为实际子预层，故 $A(C)\\subseteq P(C)$ 且限制为 $P$ 限制在这些子集上的函数。$C,D$ 为对象，$u:D\\to C$。筛、极大筛和筛逆像采用 [[14-df-sieve]]、[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]；$1$ 为 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 中逐点取 $\\{*\\}$ 的终预层。自然变换均采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的带源靶三元组。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴；$P$ 为预层，$A\\subseteq P$ 为实际子预层，故 $A(C)\\subseteq P(C)$ 且限制为 $P$ 限制在这些子集上的函数。$C,D$ 为对象，$u:D\\to C$。筛、极大筛和筛逆像采用 [[14-df-sieve]]、[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]；$1$ 为 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 中逐点取 $\\{*\\}$ 的终预层。自然变换均采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的带源靶三元组。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"93c6dd137bf8628e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴；$P$ 为预层，$A\\subseteq P$ 为实际子预层，故 $A(C)\\subseteq P(C)$ 且限制为 $P$ 限制在这些子集上的函数。$C,D$ 为对象，$u:D\\to C$。筛、极大筛和筛逆像采用 [[14-df-sieve]]、[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]；$1$ 为 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 中逐点取 $\\{*\\}$ 的终预层。自然变换均采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的带源靶三元组。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴；$P$ 为预层，$A\\subseteq P$ 为实际子预层，故 $A(C)\\subseteq P(C)$ 且限制为 $P$ 限制在这些子集上的函数。$C,D$ 为对象，$u:D\\to C$。筛、极大筛和筛逆像采用 [[14-df-sieve]]、[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]；$1$ 为 [[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]] 中逐点取 $\\{*\\}$ 的终预层。自然变换均采用 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的带源靶三元组。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"A(C)\\subseteq P(C)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"C,D","display":false},{"tex":"u:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\{*\\}","display":false},{"tex":"t_C:=\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C),\\qquad\\Omega_0(C):=\\{S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\mid\\operatorname{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(S,C)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega_1(u):=(\\Omega_0(C),\\Omega_0(D),(S\\mapsto\\operatorname{PullSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(u,S))),\\qquad\\Omega:=(\\Omega_0,\\Omega_1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{true}:=\\left(1,\\Omega,\\left((\\{*\\},\\Omega(C),(*\\mapsto t_C))\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_A:=\\left(P,\\Omega,\\left(\\left(P(C),\\Omega(C),\\left(p\\mapsto\\{u\\in t_C\\mid P(u)(p)\\in A(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\}\\right)\\right)\\right)_{C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_A(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A(P(v)p)=v^*\\chi_A(p)","display":false}],"bytes":2246,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier|df-192 — 预层的筛真值对象与特征映射]]"},{"id":"10d7b3d339017c15","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对子层 $A$，若 $g^*c_{A,C}(x)$ 覆盖，则 $F(g)(x)$ 的这个覆盖上的全部限制都落在 $A$；$A$ 的层粘合与 $F$ 的唯一性给 $F(g)(x)\\in A$，所以特征筛闭。恒等式 $c_{A,D}(F(g)(x))=g^*c_{A,C}(x)$ 证明自然性。每个集合属于 $\\mathcal U$，类型包装与本书函子范畴一致。它将[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]]的全部筛构造限制到闭筛，补足站点层范畴的具体真值对象。"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]]"},{"id":"d061a7977fcae989","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier|df-192 — 预层的筛真值对象与特征映射]]"},{"id":"abb55776f8cac91e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$\\Omega,\\operatorname{true},\\chi_A$ 为 [[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]] 的构造，$A\\subseteq P$ 为子预层，$m:A\\hookrightarrow P$ 为包含。$!_A:A\\to1$ 是唯一终对象箭头。"}],"outgoing":["1bdaf4a293143165","93c6dd137bf8628e","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","55b5b594c94a4b33","300365f146cacc8a"]}